BEFORE THAT, ALONGSIDE BRIT HUME

00:03:43.439 --> 00:03:44.540
BEFORE THAT, ALONGSIDE BRIT HUM

00:03:44.306 --> 00:03:46.642
BRIT HUME.

00:03:44.673 --> 00:03:49.278
HE COULD CUT THROUGH THE NOISE

00:03:46.775 --> 00:03:50.913
