00:03:51.046 --> 00:03:53.849
NOBODY ELSE COULD.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:56.418
SO HE JUST HAD A GIFT.

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:58.354
HIS WRITING WAS ON LIKE -- I

