00:05:16.999 --> 00:05:22.404
COMMERCIAL BREAKS BEFORE THE

00:05:21.837 --> 00:05:22.738
TIME, THAT I GOT TO SPEND WITH

00:05:22.538 --> 00:05:23.572
CHARLES.

00:05:22.871 --> 00:05:25.574
