00:05:40.255 --> 00:05:42.458
THIS SHOW TONIGHT.

00:05:41.323 --> 00:05:42.825
I WOULD LIKE YOUR REACTION AND

00:05:42.591 --> 00:05:44.193
THOUGHTS.

