LET'S WATCH.

00:05:44.326 --> 00:05:49.031
&gt;&gt; 30 YEARS.

00:05:47.329 --> 00:05:50.799
DO YOU EVER LOOK BACK ON SOME OF

00:05:49.164 --> 00:05:51.266
THESE WRITINGS AND THINK, WHAT

00:05:50.933 --> 00:05:54.370
