WORST PART OF WRITING THE BOOK

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:02.444
WAS GOING ALL THE WAY BACK AND

00:06:00.743 --> 00:06:03.212
READING THE MILLION WORDS I'VE

00:06:02.578 --> 00:06:04.213
WRITTEN, COULDN'T BELIEVE I HAD

00:06:03.345 --> 00:06:06.482
WRITTEN SOME OF THAT STUFF.

