&gt;&gt; WHAT HAS THE GROWTH PROCESS

00:06:06.615 --> 00:06:09.284
BEEN LIKE?

00:06:07.349 --> 00:06:13.022
&gt;&gt; THE GROWTH PROCESS, WELL, I

00:06:09.418 --> 00:06:16.392
WAS ONCE A LIBERAL.

00:06:14.289 --> 00:06:19.094
&gt;&gt; SO THE EARLY WRITINGS SHOWED

00:06:16.859 --> 00:06:23.198
HOPE.

